  m_text: 'While Ah Koon brewed the coffee, his wife perfected the Kaya! In 1936,
    she created her own secret recipe using eggs, sugar, and coconut milk.


    Paired
    with bread grilled over charcoal for that signature smoky crunch, it became the
    legendary breakfast we love today.'
